{"availability":"available","full":"obake2ai/BotanicalIntelligence","name":"BotanicalIntelligence","description":"Distributed sound-and-light installation: 100 edge computers, each running a small language model offline, networked like mycorrhiza and listening to plants. Parallel Forests, CCBT 2026.","category":"Other","language":"Python","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-04-08T06:11:13Z","updated":"2026-09-15T09:21:16Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://obake2ai.info/projects/botanical-intelligence/","topics":["ai-art","alien-intelligence","art","botanical-intelligence","ccbt","edge-ai","installation-art","m5stack","slm"],"demo":null,"color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-04T05:14:13.358Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-04T05:14:13.358Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-04T05:14:13.358Z","lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-04T05:14:13.358Z","discoveredVia":[],"metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-04T05:14:13.358Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A distributed sound-and-light installation in which 100 edge computers, each running a small language model (SLM) offline on an onboard NPU, form a rhizomatic network modeled on the mycorrhizal communication systems of forests. Each device — a Botanical Intelligence (BI) — receives live biosignals from surrounding vegetation and translates them into whispered fragments of language and synchronized pulses of light, producing a site-responsive soundscape that shifts with the plants' health, stress, and rhythms.","The project reframes AI as Alien Intelligence — not a simulation of human cognition optimized for efficiency, but an unknowable other whose outputs arise from genuinely nonhuman data."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/obake2ai/BotanicalIntelligence/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"3d786b8a74c4d4ff8e1171021deb0183f735630dac9b67128c55b514a35cc269","extractedAt":"2026-10-04T05:14:13.358Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10